{
  "_README": [
    "TEMPLATE 5 — /about  (the ORGANIZATION about page)",
    "",
    "USE AboutPage HERE, NOT ProfilePage.",
    "",
    "Google's ProfilePage guidelines require that 'the primary focus of the page must be a",
    "single person or organization.' Their own list of what does NOT qualify includes pages",
    "that 'contain lots of non-profile info'. Your /about page has Company Overview, The Client",
    "Experience, a resources block and Meet the Team — four different subjects. That is an",
    "AboutPage.",
    "",
    "Your live markup already uses AboutPage. Keep it. This template just completes it.",
    "",
    "WHAT CHANGES vs your live markup",
    "  1. The Organization inside mainEntity was a stub missing address, contactPoint, sameAs",
    "     and telephone. Replaced with a reference to the shared business node.",
    "  2. No image, no breadcrumb link, no isPartOf.",
    "  3. Once the team content moves to /about/team, add the significantLink / relatedLink",
    "     pointer shown at the bottom so the two pages are connected.",
    "",
    "RICH RESULT ELIGIBILITY: Breadcrumbs, plus the Organization entity signals. AboutPage",
    "itself produces no rich result.",
    "",
    "Strip all _README and _comment keys before shipping."
  ],

  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [

    {
      "_comment": "SHARED BUSINESS NODE — ship the COMPLETE version from _business-node.jsonld. Abbreviated here for readability.",
      "@type": "RecyclingCenter",
      "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/#organization",
      "name": "Core Asset Solutions",
      "url": "https://core-asset-sol.com/",
      "email": "info@core-asset-sol.com",
      "telephone": "+1-513-433-7818",
      "priceRange": "$$",
      "logo": {
        "@type": "ImageObject",
        "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/#logo",
        "url": "https://core-asset-sol.com/assets/logo_website_final_cropped2.png",
        "width": 402, "height": 372, "caption": "Core Asset Solutions"
      },
      "image": { "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/#logo" },
      "address": {
        "@type": "PostalAddress",
        "streetAddress": "457 S Cooper Ave.",
        "addressLocality": "Lockland",
        "addressRegion": "OH",
        "postalCode": "45215",
        "addressCountry": "US"
      },
      "geo": { "@type": "GeoCoordinates", "latitude": "39.2241279", "longitude": "-84.4604809" },

      "_comment_sameAs": [
        "THE COMPANY LinkedIn page lives HERE and ONLY here.",
        "Note the URL shape: linkedin.com/COMPANY/... — that path segment is what distinguishes",
        "an organization page from a member profile. Personal profiles use linkedin.com/IN/...",
        "and belong on the Person node, never in this array. See 6-team-page.jsonld."
      ],
      "sameAs": [
        "https://www.linkedin.com/company/coreassetsolutions/",
        "https://www.facebook.com/CoreAssetSolutions/",
        "https://www.instagram.com/coreassetsolutions/",
        "https://x.com/coreassetsol"
      ],

      "_comment_employee": [
        "Optional but useful once /about/team exists. Links the org to its people by @id, which",
        "is what lets Google connect an article author to the company without you repeating the",
        "person's details on every page.",
        "Only list people who actually have a Person node defined somewhere on the site."
      ],
      "employee": [
        { "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/about/team#will-gibson" },
        { "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/about/team#REPLACE-person-two" },
        { "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/about/team#REPLACE-person-three" }
      ]
    },

    {
      "@type": "WebSite",
      "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/#website",
      "url": "https://core-asset-sol.com/",
      "name": "Core Asset Solutions",
      "inLanguage": "en-US",
      "publisher": { "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/#organization" }
    },

    {
      "_comment": "Add a real photo of the facility or team here — not the logo. /about currently has no declared image and og:image points at the logo.",
      "@type": "ImageObject",
      "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/about#primaryimage",
      "url": "https://core-asset-sol.com/assets/REPLACE-about-hero.png",
      "contentUrl": "https://core-asset-sol.com/assets/REPLACE-about-hero.png",
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 630,
      "caption": "Core Asset Solutions, IT asset disposition and electronics recycling in Lockland, Ohio",
      "representativeOfPage": true
    },

    {
      "@type": "AboutPage",
      "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/about#webpage",
      "url": "https://core-asset-sol.com/about",
      "name": "About Core Asset Solutions",
      "description": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_UPDATED_META_DESCRIPTION",
      "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/#website" },
      "breadcrumb": { "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/about#breadcrumb" },
      "primaryImageOfPage": { "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/about#primaryimage" },
      "inLanguage": "en-US",

      "_comment_mainEntity": "A bare @id reference, because the full node is already in this graph. This is what your live markup was reaching for with its 4-property Organization stub.",
      "mainEntity": { "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/#organization" },
      "about": { "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/#organization" },

      "_comment_relatedLink": "Add once /about/team exists. Makes the parent/child relationship explicit rather than relying on the nav link alone.",
      "relatedLink": "https://core-asset-sol.com/about/team"
    },

    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/about#breadcrumb",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://core-asset-sol.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": "https://core-asset-sol.com/about" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
